<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Qualitative results</h2>

<div id="A4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#A4.F5" title="Figure 5 ‣ Appendix D Qualitative results ‣ LowDiff: Efficient Diffusion Sampling with Low-Resolution Condition" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> and  <a href="#A4.F6" title="Figure 6 ‣ Appendix D Qualitative results ‣ LowDiff: Efficient Diffusion Sampling with Low-Resolution Condition" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> present generated images for unconditional CIFAR10 and class-conditional CIFAR10 using the trained unified model, which can generate both <math id="A4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="16\times 16" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">16\times 16</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="32\times 32" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>32</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>32</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">32\times 32</annotation></semantics></math> images. Figure <a href="#A4.F7" title="Figure 7 ‣ Appendix D Qualitative results ‣ LowDiff: Efficient Diffusion Sampling with Low-Resolution Condition" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a> shows generated images for FFHQ <math id="A4.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="64\times 64" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>64</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>64</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">64\times 64</annotation></semantics></math> using the trained unified model, which can generate both <math id="A4.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="32\times 32" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>32</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>32</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">32\times 32</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A4.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="64\times 64" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>64</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>64</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">64\times 64</annotation></semantics></math> images.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A4.F5" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.15342v1/combined_image_CIFAR10UNC.png" id="A4.F5.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/287;" width="476" height="287" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A4.F5.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 5</span>: </span><span id="A4.F5.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Generated images for unconditional CIFAR10.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A4.F6" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.15342v1/combined_image_CIFAR10C.png" id="A4.F6.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:476/399;" width="476" height="399" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A4.F6.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 6</span>: </span><span id="A4.F6.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Generated images for class-conditional CIFAR10.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A4.F7" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.15342v1/combined_image_FFHQ.png" id="A4.F7.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/298;" width="476" height="298" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A4.F7.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 7</span>: </span><span id="A4.F7.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Generated images for FFHQ 64x64.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
